{"unit_id":"koi128bit__dsh-session-git#card-zh","repo":"koi128bit/dsh-session-git","commit":"26b0811c3a2ece4902ba978436636174ec12b593","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-git 是一个 DSH Web 插件，在每个会话的对话视图中加入 Git 页签，并根据当前会话选择对应的仓库。面板展示提交历史图、分支与标签、提交详情、文件差异和工作区状态，也提供切换分支、暂存、提交、合并、stash 等本地操作。它通过 DSH Connection 提供的接口读取仓库，并将仓库选择按会话分别记忆，适合希望在 DSH 对话中查看并处理项目版本历史的开发者。运行需要 Node.js 22+ 和 Git；兼容 DSH 0.2.x 指定版本，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2032-2044","index.js:598-678","index.js:852-906","package.json:29-34"]}
{"unit_id":"koi128bit__dsh-session-git#card-en","repo":"koi128bit/dsh-session-git","commit":"26b0811c3a2ece4902ba978436636174ec12b593","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-git adds a Git tab to DSH conversations, showing each session's repository history, commit details, diffs, branches, and working tree. Developers can inspect changes and stage, commit, merge, or stash them locally. It requires Node.js 22+ and Git and supports DSH 0.2.x.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2032-2044","index.js:598-678","index.js:852-906","package.json:29-34"]}
