{"unit_id":"koi128bit__dsh-session-git#feature-1","repo":"koi128bit/dsh-session-git","commit":"26b0811c3a2ece4902ba978436636174ec12b593","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-git 的功能「会话 Git 历史」：在对话页签中查看该会话仓库的提交列表和分支泳道。打开 Git 页签后，面板按当前 sessionId 解析仓库并加载历史。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2035-2044","index.js:229-284","index.js:679-700"]}
{"unit_id":"koi128bit__dsh-session-git#feature-2","repo":"koi128bit/dsh-session-git","commit":"26b0811c3a2ece4902ba978436636174ec12b593","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-git 的功能「提交详情和差异」：查看提交作者、时间、文件增删统计和提交说明，并按文件读取差异。用户选择提交或文件时，面板通过详情与 diff 接口返回相应内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:725-777"]}
{"unit_id":"koi128bit__dsh-session-git#feature-3","repo":"koi128bit/dsh-session-git","commit":"26b0811c3a2ece4902ba978436636174ec12b593","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-git 的功能「工作区操作」：查看暂存、未暂存和未跟踪文件，并可暂存、取消暂存、丢弃改动或提交。用户在工作区面板选择动作后，由 action 接口调用对应的本地 Git 操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:779-790","index.js:852-906"]}
{"unit_id":"koi128bit__dsh-session-git#feature-4","repo":"koi128bit/dsh-session-git","commit":"26b0811c3a2ece4902ba978436636174ec12b593","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-git 的功能「分支、标签与暂存记录」：列出本地和远程分支、标签及 stash，并支持本地切换、创建或删除分支标签、合并分支和取出 stash。用户从面板的引用与暂存区域触发操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:701-724","index.js:852-906"]}
{"unit_id":"koi128bit__dsh-session-git#caveat-1","repo":"koi128bit/dsh-session-git","commit":"26b0811c3a2ece4902ba978436636174ec12b593","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-git 使用前须知：面板提供本地历史操作，没有开放 push、pull 或 fetch；这些远程同步操作需要在终端执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:852-872"]}
